{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manchester Airport</strong> (IATA: <strong>MAN</strong>, ICAO: <strong>EGCC</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Major airport in the UK, 4th busiest  in terms of passenger numbers and the busiest airport in the UK,\u00a0 located at Ringway in the City of Manchester within Greater Manchester, UK. It was also the 3rd busiest UK airport in terms of total aircraft movements, and the 24th busiest airport in Europe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816780/extras/3__1_.jpg?t=1750156284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The airport comprises a cargo terminal and three passenger terminals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminals 1 and 2 are linked by the <i>skylink</i>, with travelators to aid passengers with the 10\u201315-minute walk. Terminal 3 is linked to Terminal 1 and the <i>skylink</i> by a covered walkway.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminal 1:\u00a0Terminal 1 is used by airlines with scheduled and charter operations, flying to European and other worldwide destinations. It is the second largest terminal at the airport.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminal 2: is spread over an area of 52,000\u00a0m2 (560,000\u00a0sq\u00a0ft) and has 20 gates, of which 16 have air bridges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816780/extras/7.jpg?t=1750156284\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816780?t=1750156284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816780/52321d6e8b550f569c59aaa1d5e8adbbafb321a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750156284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i